   <https://www.democrata.es/en/agriculture-food/agriculture-reinforces-its=
-support-for-the-alicante-mountain-cherry-with-new-aid-to-ensure-its-future=
/>
   ]
   - *Tours:* Travelers can book direct Alicante Olive Oil Tour experiences
   to see the mountain groves firsthand. [1
   <https://www.getyourguide.com/alicante-l414/alicante-olive-oil-tour-with=
