   - *Severe Drought:* Extended lack of rain in the *Comtat* and *Marina
   Alta* regions has severely stressed non-irrigated mountain groves.
   - *Crop Abandonment:* Due to escalating costs (diesel, self-employment
   fees, brush-cutters) and unpredictable yields, land dedicated to cherry
   cultivation has decreased.
   - *Pests & Climate:* Unpredictable cold hours and the *Drosophila
   suzukii* (spotted-wing drosophila) pest have severely impacted harvests.
