isting late
   spring frosts better than cherries.
   - *Water Needs:* Exceptionally drought-tolerant compared to stone fruits=
.
   - *Economics:* Known as "green gold"; commands =E2=82=AC$7=E2=80=9312/kg=
 but requires
   5=E2=80=937 years to yield a first meaningful harvest. [1
   <https://www.facebook.com/AFPnewsenglish/videos/droughts-drive-spains-pi=
stachio-farming-boom/1733641634135901/>,
   2
   <https://newseu.cgtn.com/news/2022-10-31/The-rise-of-Spain-s-green-gold-=
the-humble-profitable-pistachio-1eyPE4vX58A/index.html>,
