o-nuts-olives-grapes-wheat-drought-resistant-crop>
   ]

2. Modern Almonds (Prunus dulcis)

   - *Climate Fit:* Traditional to Alicante, but new self-pollinating,
   late-blooming varieties (e.g., Guara, Soleta) protect against late frost=
